  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Research</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding to Geneva Call (GC), the only organisation in the world focused exclusively on creating lasting behavioural change among armed groups and de facto authorities (AGDAs) to promote the protection of civilians. Core funding is provided to support the implementation of GC&apos;s Strategic Plan. The core of Geneva Call&#x2019;s work is to improve the protection of civilians during armed conflicts by encouraging AGDA&apos;s to comply with IHL and with relevant International Human Rights Law (IHRL) norms.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Suppporting GC&apos;s work in conflict affected humanitarian crises across the globe to strengthen the impact on the civilian populations who bear the brunt of conflict. CG&apos;s work is focused in 16 contexts globally including Yemen, Mali, DRC, South Sudan, Iraq, Syria, Afghanistan and Myanmar.</narrative>
  </description>
